        <p source="#source-33925-33995"><seg source="#source-33925-33934">仲秋や</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33934-33958"><rb>院宣</rb><rt>いんぜん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33958-33967">をまつ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33967-33979"><rb>湖</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33979-33995">のほとり</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-33995-34048"><seg source="#source-33995-34022">仲秋をつつむ一句の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-34022-34040"><rb>主</rb><rt>あるじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-34040-34048">かな</seg></p>
