        <p source="#source-34282-34382"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-34282-34297"><rb>凡</rb><rt>およ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-34297-34309">そ天下に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-34309-34333"><rb>去来</rb><rt>きょらい</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-34333-34348"><rb>程</rb><rt>ほど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-34348-34382">の小さき墓に参りけり</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-34382-34452"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-34382-34406"><rb>由公</rb><rt>よしこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-34406-34424">の墓に参るや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-34424-34439"><rb>供</rb><rt>とも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-34439-34452">連れて</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-34452-34508"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-34452-34467"><rb>此</rb><rt>この</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-34467-34508">墓に系図はじまるや拝みけり</seg></p>
      </div>
