        <div type="layout" source="#source-34543-34703" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-34590-34661"><seg source="#source-34590-34661">明治四十一年八月二十三日　日盛会。第二十一回。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-34745-34798"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-34745-34763"><rb>螽</rb><rt>いなご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-34763-34798">とぶ音杼に似て低きかな</seg></p>
