        <div type="layout" source="#source-34833-34993" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-34880-34951"><seg source="#source-34880-34951">明治四十一年八月二十五日　日盛会。第二十三回。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-35035-35079"><seg source="#source-35035-35079">芋を掘る手をそのままに上京す</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-35079-35312" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-35114-35274" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-35161-35232"><seg source="#source-35161-35232">明治四十一年八月二十七日　日盛会。第二十五回。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-35316-35384"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35316-35331"><rb>園</rb><rt>その</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35331-35352">に聞く人語新し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35352-35382"><rb>野分跡</rb><rt>のわきあと</rt></ruby></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-35384-35620" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-35419-35582" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-35466-35540"><seg source="#source-35466-35499">明治四十一年　秋。村上</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35499-35526"><rb>霽月</rb><rt>せいげつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35526-35540">来小会。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
