        <div type="layout" source="#source-110409-110629" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-110456-110587"><seg source="#source-110456-110516">昭和七年四月十二日　京都石田旅館にあり。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110516-110534"><rb>安倍</rb><rt>あべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110534-110537">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110537-110558"><rb>和辻</rb><rt>わつじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110558-110587">両君来り、謡二番。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-110671-110748"><seg source="#source-110671-110680">山寺の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110680-110710"><rb>古文書</rb><rt>こもんじょ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110710-110719">も無く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-110719-110740"><rb>長閑</rb><rt>のどか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-110740-110748">なり</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-110748-110978" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-110783-110940" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-110830-110898"><seg source="#source-110830-110898">昭和七年四月十六日　蜻蛉会。西山十輪寺吟行。</seg></p>
