        <p source="#source-111052-111132"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111052-111067"><rb>聾</rb><rt>ろう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111067-111088"><rb>青畝</rb><rt>せいほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111088-111115">ひとり離れて花下に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111115-111127"><rb>笑</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111127-111132">む</seg></p>
