      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-111360-111419"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111360-111381"><rb>燕</rb><rt>つばくろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111381-111419">のゆるく飛び居る何の意ぞ</seg></p>
