        <div type="layout" source="#source-111454-111614" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-111501-111572"><seg source="#source-111501-111572">昭和七年五月七日　水竹居祝賀会。四ツ木吉野園。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-111656-111709"><seg source="#source-111656-111683">春の浜大いなる輪が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-111683-111695"><rb>画</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-111695-111709">いてある</seg></p>
