        <div type="layout" source="#source-111744-111904" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-111791-111862"><seg source="#source-111791-111862">昭和七年五月九日　笹鳴会。片瀬西浜、保岡別邸。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-111946-111987"><seg source="#source-111946-111987">夏草に黄色き魚を釣り上げし</seg></p>
