        <div type="layout" source="#source-112022-112209" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-112069-112167"><seg source="#source-112069-112117">昭和七年六月五日　武蔵野探勝会。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112117-112147"><rb>石神井</rb><rt>しゃくじい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112147-112167">、三宝寺池。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
