      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-112580-112663"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112580-112607"><rb>榛名湖</rb><rt>はるなこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112607-112631">のふちのあやめに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112631-112655"><rb>床几</rb><rt>しょうぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112655-112663">かな</seg></p>
