        <div type="layout" source="#source-112698-112882" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-112745-112840"><seg source="#source-112745-112778">昭和七年七月三十一日　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112778-112802"><rb>伊香保</rb><rt>いかほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112802-112840">に遊び、榛名湖にいたる。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-112924-112992"><seg source="#source-112924-112936">落花のむ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112936-112951"><rb>鯉</rb><rt>こい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112951-112969">はしやれもの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112969-112984"><rb>髭</rb><rt>ひげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112984-112992">長し</seg></p>
