      <div type="layout" source="#source-112992-113249" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-113027-113211" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-113074-113169"><seg source="#source-113074-113134">昭和七年九月四日　武蔵野探勝会。南拝島、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113134-113152"><rb>日吉</rb><rt>ひえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113152-113169">神社社前。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-113253-113297"><seg source="#source-113253-113297">夜学すすむ教師の声の低きまま</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-113297-113551" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-113332-113513" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-113379-113471">昭和七年九月十日　『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113409-113436"><rb>山茶花</rb><rt>さざんか</rt></ruby>』十週年記念大会兼題。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-113555-113614"><seg source="#source-113555-113570">くはれもす</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113570-113591"><rb>八雲</rb><rt>やくも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113591-113614">旧居の秋の蚊に</seg></p>
