        <div type="layout" source="#source-113649-113821" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-113696-113779"><seg source="#source-113696-113723">昭和七年十月八日　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113723-113744"><rb>出雲</rb><rt>いずも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113744-113779">松江。八雲旧居を訪ふ。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-113863-113913"><seg source="#source-113863-113887">秋風の急に寒しや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113887-113902"><rb>分</rb><rt>わけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113902-113913">の茶屋</seg></p>
