      <div type="layout" source="#source-113913-114179" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-113948-114141" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-113995-114099"><seg source="#source-113995-114031">昭和七年十月九日　松江を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114031-114043"><rb>発</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114043-114046">ち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114046-114070"><rb>大山</rb><rt>だいせん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114070-114099">に向ふ。大山登山。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-114183-114251"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114183-114207"><rb>遅月</rb><rt>おそづき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114207-114219">の上りて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114219-114237"><rb>暇</rb><rt>いとま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114237-114251">申しけり</seg></p>
