        <div type="layout" source="#source-114286-114461" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-114333-114419"><seg source="#source-114333-114363">昭和七年十月十九日　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114363-114387"><rb>嵯峨野</rb><rt>さがの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114387-114419">吟行。二条、巨陶居。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-114503-114561"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-114503-114527"><rb>山間</rb><rt>やまあい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-114527-114561">の霧の小村に人と成る</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-114561-114602"><seg source="#source-114561-114602">顔よせて人話し居る夜霧かな</seg></p>
