      <div type="layout" source="#source-114602-114826" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-114637-114788" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-114684-114746"><seg source="#source-114684-114746">昭和七年十月二十日　木槿会。大阪倶楽部。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-114830-114874"><seg source="#source-114830-114874">大小の木の実を人にたとへたり</seg></p>
