        <div type="layout" source="#source-115211-115470" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-115258-115428"><seg source="#source-115258-115294">昭和八年一月一日　鎌倉宅</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115294-115321"><rb>病臥</rb><rt>びょうが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115321-115324">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115324-115345"><rb>皿井</rb><rt>さらい</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115345-115372"><rb>旭川</rb><rt>きょくせん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115372-115378">来、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115378-115402"><rb>枕頭</rb><rt>ちんとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115402-115428">に壺の図を描く。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-115512-115577"><seg source="#source-115512-115518">つく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115518-115536"><rb>羽子</rb><rt>ばね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115536-115551">の静に高し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115551-115566"><rb>誰</rb><rt>たれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115566-115577">やらん</seg></p>
