        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-115805-115882"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115805-115829"><rb>襟巻</rb><rt>えりまき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115829-115832">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115832-115850"><rb>狐</rb><rt>きつね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115850-115865">の顔は別に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-115865-115877"><rb>在</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-115877-115882">り</seg></p>
