        <div type="layout" source="#source-115917-116101" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-115964-116059"><seg source="#source-115964-116024">昭和八年一月十二日　七宝会。松韻社にて。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-116024-116048"><rb>日比谷</rb><rt>ひびや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-116048-116059">公園。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-116143-116208"><seg source="#source-116143-116161">つづけさまに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-116161-116179"><rb>嚔</rb><rt>くさめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-116179-116208">して威儀くづれけり</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-116208-116423" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-116243-116385" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-116290-116343"><seg source="#source-116290-116343">昭和八年一月二十一日　家庭俳句会。</seg></p>
