      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-116427-116495"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-116427-116454"><rb>凍蝶</rb><rt>いてちょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-116454-116457">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-116457-116472"><rb>己</rb><rt>おの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-116472-116495">が魂追うて飛ぶ</seg></p>
