        <div type="layout" source="#source-116530-116684" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-116577-116642"><seg source="#source-116577-116642">昭和八年一月二十六日　丸之内倶楽部俳句会。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-116726-116800"><seg source="#source-116726-116750">雪解くるささやき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-116750-116765"><rb>滋</rb><rt>しげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-116765-116768">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-116768-116798"><rb>小笹原</rb><rt>おざさはら</rt></ruby></p>
