      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-117019-117081"><seg source="#source-117019-117028">紅梅の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-117028-117046"><rb>莟</rb><rt>つぼみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-117046-117055">は固し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-117055-117073"><rb>言</rb><rt>ものい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-117073-117081">はず</seg></p>
